{"availability":"available","full":"AmirrezaFarnamTaheri/Collegeum","name":"Collegeum","description":"Zero-budget pipeline & live web dashboard tracking predoctoral, pre-PhD, and quantitative research positions in economics and social sciences.","category":"Finance","language":"Python","stars":1,"forks":0,"created":"2026-10-02T22:50:29Z","updated":"2026-10-11T23:12:00Z","license":null,"branch":"main","homepage":"https://amirrezafarnamtaheri.github.io/Collegeum","topics":["academic-jobs","economics","finance","github-pages","job-board","pipeline","predoc","predoctoral","public-policy","quantitative-social-science","research-assistant","telegram-bot"],"demo":"https://amirrezafarnamtaheri.github.io/Collegeum","color":"#193546","ink":"#a6d6e8","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-12T02:04:54.552Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-12T02:04:54.552Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-12T02:04:54.552Z","metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-08T18:25:58.010Z","stars":1,"forks":0},{"at":"2026-10-11T06:12:54.916Z","stars":1,"forks":0},{"at":"2026-10-12T02:04:54.552Z","stars":1,"forks":0}],"technologies":["Python"],"overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["An automated pipeline that discovers, deduplicates, and broadcasts pre-doctoral research assistantships, fellowships, and academic research openings in economics, finance, public policy, and quantitative social science across the UK, Europe, Canada, the US, and international research institutions to Telegram and X/Twitter daily, at zero dollar cost.","The pipeline monitors academic job boards (PREDOC.org, EconJobMarket, European Job Market, jobs.ac.uk, EURAXESS, SOMMA, academics.de), university applicant tracking systems (Workday, Varbi), department career pages, RSS/Atom feeds, and X/Twitter accounts (via official X API v2 and Xquik). It filters out unrelated vacancies through a deterministic gate, extracts structured metadata (deadlines, supervisors, visa sponsorship, application links, and filled status), deduplicates cross-posted listings across three tiers (URL hash, MinHash/LSH, fuzzy composite keys), and broadcasts new positions to…","No paid API keys are required: without GEMINIAPIKEY, a built-in heuristic extractor parses vacancy pages. When configured, Gemini provides structured LLM extraction subject to the same policy rules."],"features":[],"sourceUrl":"https://github.com/AmirrezaFarnamTaheri/Collegeum/blob/main/README.md","fingerprint":"06c52b7b443c271909fe09429bd678abc47382e61e6d44bf2c638af99e02af95","extractedAt":"2026-10-12T02:04:54.703Z"},"overviewCheckedAt":"2026-10-12T02:04:54.703Z","projectInsights":{"version":1,"whatItDoes":{"text":"An automated pipeline that discovers, deduplicates, and broadcasts pre-doctoral research assistantships, fellowships, and academic research openings in economics, finance, public policy, and quantitative social science across the UK, Europe, Canada, the US, and international research institutions to Telegram and X/Twitter daily, at zero dollar cost.","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/AmirrezaFarnamTaheri/Collegeum/blob/main/README.md"},"audience":[],"requirements":[{"kind":"api_key","status":"not_required","text":"No paid API keys are required: without GEMINIAPIKEY, a built-in heuristic extractor parses vacancy pages.","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/AmirrezaFarnamTaheri/Collegeum/blob/main/README.md"},{"kind":"paid_service","status":"not_required","text":"No paid API keys are required: without GEMINIAPIKEY, a built-in heuristic extractor parses vacancy pages.","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/AmirrezaFarnamTaheri/Collegeum/blob/main/README.md"}],"fingerprint":"06c52b7b443c271909fe09429bd678abc47382e61e6d44bf2c638af99e02af95","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/AmirrezaFarnamTaheri/Collegeum/blob/main/README.md","checkedAt":"2026-10-12T02:04:54.704Z"},"overviewRepoUpdated":"2026-10-11T23:12:00Z","readmeSnapshot":{"version":1,"status":"saved","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/AmirrezaFarnamTaheri/Collegeum/blob/main/README.md","checkedAt":"2026-10-12T02:04:54.704Z","hash":"